WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.808
Day 1, August 5

2
00:00:07.809 --> 00:00:17.077
We moved into our cabins today.

3
00:00:17.078 --> 00:00:25.232
"I want the top bunk!"

4
00:00:25.233 --> 00:00:29.398
Day 2, August 6

5
00:00:29.399 --> 00:00:35.471
We went on a hike at half past eight.

6
00:00:35.472 --> 00:00:39.932
"Ouch! Mosquito bites!"

7
00:00:39.933 --> 00:00:47.032
We played volleyball at a quarter past two.

8
00:00:47.033 --> 00:00:55.266
"The blue team wins!"

9
00:00:55.267 --> 00:00:59.425
Day 3, August 7

10
00:00:59.426 --> 00:01:04.344
We rowed canoes at half past ten.

11
00:01:04.345 --> 00:01:11.102
"Let's race!"

12
00:01:11.103 --> 00:01:16.719
We made clay mugs at two.

13
00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:23.720
"Wow! Yours looks great!"

14
00:01:23.721 --> 00:01:27.457
Day 4, August 8

15
00:01:27.458 --> 00:01:34.755
We had a bonfire at a quarter to seven.

16
00:01:34.756 --> 00:01:37.984
"Who wants s'mores?"

17
00:01:37.985 --> 00:01:43.248
Bob told scary stories at half past eight.

18
00:01:43.249 --> 00:01:54.155
"The monster was very hairy . . ."

19
00:01:54.156 --> 00:01:58.299
Day 5, August 9

20
00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:08.825
Today was the last day of camp.

21
00:02:08.826 --> 00:02:20.606
See you next year, Bob and Liz.

